{"id":"gruppe","lemma":"Gruppe","pos":"noun","rank":968,"glosses":["group"],"ipa":"/ˈɡʁʊpə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/57/De-Gruppe.ogg/De-Gruppe.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Gruppe","plural":"Gruppen"},"examples":[{"text":"Ich muss bei der Gruppe bleiben.","en":"I have to stay with the group.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"at / with"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to remain"}]},{"text":"Bleibt in kleinen Gruppen.","en":"Keep in small groups.","words":[{"g":"to remain","l":"bleiben"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"small, little, wee","l":"klein"},null]},{"text":"Zu welcher Gruppe gehört dein Freund?","en":"Which group is your friend in?","words":[{"g":"to / too"},{"g":"which"},null,{"g":"to hear through the ear)","l":"hören"},{"g":"your"},{"g":"friend"}]},{"text":"Die ganze Gruppe lacht.","en":"The whole group is laughing.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"entire","l":"ganz"},null,{"g":"to laugh","l":"lachen"}]},{"text":"Die Gruppe arbeitete weiter.","en":"The group continued working.","words":[{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to work","l":"arbeiten"},{"g":"further, farther, more"}]}]}